OL,3,GNEWSALibrary evacuated after threats,
OL,4,Apolice say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA library has been evacuated after
OL,7,Fthreats a device had been placed at the
OL,8,Fsite, police have said.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called at about 11:50 BST to
OL,12,FChurston Library in Paignton, Devon,
OL,13,Ffollowing the threats.
OL,15,FThe premises was evacuated and a cordon
OL,16,Fwas put in place as officers carry out
OL,17,Finquiries, the force said.
OL,19,F"We are treating the matter seriously
OL,20,Fwhile investigations continue to ensure
OL,21,Fthe safety of the public," officers
OL,22,Fsaid.
